  (text "J1 carries 48 V / 5 A EPR power and USB 2.0 device data on one USB-C receptacle."
    (at 150.95750000000004 54.150000000000006 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
        (color 0 0 0 1)
      )
    )
    (uuid 98e426f1-5bbe-4666-a5b4-1d017426a1ae)
  )
  (text "U1: 48 V CC/VBUS and D+/D- protection. U2: TPS26750 EPR sink controller. U3: PD policy EEPROM. U4: hardware power-permit gate."
    (at 150.95750000000004 66.15 0)
    (effects
